ative Law"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0c98506a-6635-5b7d-af58-1312b2b0cce4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "The house is pretty and white" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186572327} {:answer/id #uuid "1375a53a-3618-5dce-89ff-9ed4d5b0ad0a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "The house is pretty but not white" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186572336} {:answer/id #uuid "3835276f-ea7e-5f22-bd0f-9f23dd7dddbf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "The house is pretty or white" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186572382} {:answer/id #uuid "3b8942ae-8000-5b3b-984c-8fc3f6700584" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "The house is pretty" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186572388} {:answer/id #uuid "9552c7de-7e25-5057-af2c-ff7e0bac67d6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "The house is not pretty or white" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186572477}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3835276f-ea7e-5f22-bd0f-9f23dd7dddbf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "The house is pretty or white" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186572382} :answer-field/id #uuid "235311f1-c145-59d8-aefe-ea3e5b1c4118" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186572600}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "9609c9d7-0f30-5ae1-9971-3c66a1bfd653" :question/math-academy-id "q-82995" :question/problem "Simplify the sentence \"The house is pretty, or it is pretty or white.\"" :question/worked-solution "First, let's rewrite the phrase \"it is pretty or white\" as the equivalent phrase \"it is pretty or it is white.\" The sentence now reads\n\n\"The house is pretty, or it is pretty or it is white.\"\n\nThen, using the associative law, we can move the comma:\n\n\"The house is pretty or it is pretty, or it is white.\"\n\nNow, we can simplify the phrase \"the house is pretty or it is pretty\" to just \"the house is pretty.\" The sentence now reads\n\n\"The house is pretty, or it is white.\"\n\nFinally, we can write the sentence more concisely as\n\n\"The house is pretty or white.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186572707 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186157241 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "149709f4-f9d8-529f-87af-a022ec1d46a8" :knowledge-point/title "Simplifying Sentences Using the Commutative Law"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4e59c528-4713-5698-be5f-fcbddba2d9d8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "The day is cold" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186572412} {:answer/id #uuid "550a21be-ab7c-5917-b44c-866f33e5ea85" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "The day is rainy" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186572416} {:answer/id #uuid "ab7553fb-2025-50c6-a6ba-fa5469315412" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "The day is cold or rainy" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186572502} {:answer/id #uuid "bc392da0-21ac-5f6d-b361-d06aed02aa11" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "The day is cold and rainy" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186572526} {:answer/id #uuid "ef6e5a88-a9d9-5f51-8504-5f972f96c069" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "The day is rainy but not cold" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186572577}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "bc392da0-21ac-5f6d-b361-d06aed02aa11" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "The day is cold and rainy" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186572526} :answer-field/id #uuid "f1008595-2a1c-5dfe-8576-a45f18af7652" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186572657}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "ac648f3a-f305-5539-9491-09df3a7946e8" :question/math-academy-id "q-83006" :question/problem "Simplify the following sentence: \"The day is rainy and it is cold, and the day is rainy.\"" :question/worked-solution "Using the commutative law, we can replace the phrase \"The day is rainy and it is cold\" with the phrase \"The day is cold and it is rainy.\" The sentence now reads\n\n\"The day is cold and it is rainy, and the day is rainy.\"\n\nThen, using the associative law, we can move the comma:\n\n\"The day is cold, and it is rainy and the day is rainy.\"\n\nNow, we can simplify the phrase \"it is rainy and the day is rainy\" to just \"it is rainy.\" The sentence now reads\n\n\"The day is cold, and it is rainy.\"\n\nFinally, we can write the sentence more concisely:\n\n\"The day is cold and rainy.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186572676 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186157241 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "149709f4-f9d8-529f-87af-a022ec1d46a8" :knowledge-point/title "Simplifying Sentences Using the Commutative Law"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "27912f86-1a55-56ce-8159-4a2a9840a974" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "The juice is orange or strawberry" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186572367} {:answer/id #uuid "413831a5-fcce-573a-9529-9e4033d14d49" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "The juice is orange but not strawberry" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186572392} {:answer/id #uuid "7ff860e9-1ecb-5c31-af96-b7c4314465c8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "The juice is strawberry" :db/id #edb/ref 1